00:50:23.754 --> 00:50:25.255
as I did in the Soviet Union."

00:50:25.255 --> 00:50:27.924 align:start size:81% position:19%
These gullible
clowns in the West

00:50:27.924 --> 00:50:30.227 align:start size:84% position:16%
who have never
experienced socialism,

00:50:30.227 --> 00:50:31.995 align:start size:84% position:16%
have never
experienced communism,

00:50:31.995 --> 00:50:35.665 align:start size:84% position:16%
who sell simple but
false ideas to people.

00:50:35.665 --> 00:50:38.235 align:start size:97% position:3%
They don't deserve to be
taken seriously. They don't.

00:50:38.235 --> 00:50:40.070 align:start size:84% position:16%
And they don't
