00:50:43.306 --> 00:50:45.842 align:start size:97% position:3%
and hurt people in this
country and around the world.

00:50:45.842 --> 00:50:48.745 align:start size:97% position:3%
It boggles my mind that
people don't understand that.

00:50:48.745 --> 00:50:50.047
But they don't.

00:50:50.047 --> 00:50:51.014
- When you, I know
you've only been,

00:50:51.014 --> 00:50:52.182
wait, how many days in America?

00:50:52.182 --> 00:50:53.683
You're in Florida for a day,

00:50:53.683 --> 00:50:55.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you've been in America
for a couple of days.

00:50:55.218 --> 00:50:56.753
- Yeah, we've been in America
about a week and a bit now.

00:50:56.753 --> 00:50:57.721
- For about a week. And how
