some odd weeks in America.

00:51:00.757 --> 00:51:02.092 align:start size:97% position:3%
You're bouncing around to some
different states, I assume.

00:51:02.092 --> 00:51:03.360
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:51:03.360 --> 00:51:06.630
- Do you sense, or maybe
