the way you describe it.

00:51:35.659 --> 00:51:36.893 align:start size:69% position:31%
You can't.
- Yeah.

00:51:36.893 --> 00:51:38.395
- It's not tricky.
It's impossible.

00:51:38.395 --> 00:51:41.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
During COVID, we, there
was no part of the country

00:51:41.832 --> 00:51:44.801
